{"seq":83,"slug":"crdt-conflict-free-types","title":"CRDT 无冲突复制数据类型","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"crdt-无冲突复制数据类型\">CRDT 无冲突复制数据类型</h1><p>想象两个人在没有网络的飞机上同时编辑同一份文档，落地后两台设备各自把改动同步上去——系统不询问任何人、不锁任何资源、不回滚任何一方，却能让两份副本收敛到同一个结果。这种「先各改各的、再自动合并且永不冲突」的能力，正是无冲突复制数据类型（Conflict-free Replicated Data Type，CRDT）想要给出的数学保证。它把分布式系统里最棘手的「并发写入如何合并」从运行期的协调问题，下沉成了数据类型本身的代数性质。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，每一条都建立在前一条之上。</p>\n<p>第一条线是<strong>基础</strong>。我们先回答「为什么要 CRDT」：当强一致性的协调代价高到无法接受、当离线优先与本地优先（local-first）成为产品诉求时，传统的加锁、共识、最后写入覆盖都各有硬伤，CRDT 提供了第三条路。随后厘清「最终一致性与收敛」的精确含义——强最终一致性（SEC）要求收到相同更新集合的副本必然相等，而这依赖因果关系的刻画（Lamport 时钟、向量时钟）。最后给出「类型概览」：把后面所有具体构造放进 CvRDT / CmRDT / δ-CRDT 三个家族的坐标系里，让读者带着地图上路。</p>\n<p>第二条线是<strong>状态型 CRDT</strong>。它的理论内核是连接半格（join-semilattice）：只要状态空间构成半格、合并就是取上确界、且每次本地更新都单调上升，收敛就被代数性质免费保证。我们用这套理论先造出计数器（G-Counter、PN-Counter），再造出各种集合（G-Set、2P-Set、OR-Set、LWW-Set），让抽象的半格在两个最常用的数据结构上落地。</p>\n<p>第三条线是<strong>操作型 CRDT</strong>。换一个视角：不传整个状态，只传操作，但要求并发操作两两可交换。我们先讲清交换性与因果投递这对前提，再进入最难也最有价值的序列与文本（RGA、YATA、Fugue、Peritext），最后处理映射与寄存器（LWW-Register、MV-Register、OR-Map）这类组合容器。</p>\n<p>第四条线是<strong>工程实践</strong>。理论再漂亮也要落地：δ-CRDT 用增量传播解决状态型「消息太大」的痛点；主流库与系统（Yjs、Automerge、Loro、Riak、Redis）展示了真实世界的取舍；最后正视陷阱与权衡——墓碑堆积、元数据膨胀、垃圾回收、安全边界，没有银弹。</p>\n<p>读完四条线，你会拥有一张从代数定义到生产部署的完整地图：知道一个数据类型为什么能无冲突合并、属于哪个家族、用哪个库实现、以及它会在哪里咬你一口。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-crdts","title":"为什么需要 CRDT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/foundations/why-crdts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"eventual-consistency","title":"最终一致性与收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/foundations/eventual-consistency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crdt-types-overview","title":"CRDT 类型概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/foundations/crdt-types-overview"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"state-based","title":"状态型 CRDT","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cvrdt-semilattice","title":"状态 CRDT 与半格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/cvrdt-semilattice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"counters","title":"计数器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/counters"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sets","title":"集合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/sets"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"op-based","title":"操作型 CRDT","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/op-based","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cmrdt-commutative","title":"操作 CRDT 与交换性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/op-based/cmrdt-commutative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sequences-text","title":"序列与文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/op-based/sequences-text"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maps-registers","title":"映射与寄存器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/op-based/maps-registers"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"delta-crdts","title":"Delta CRDT 增量状态型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/practice/delta-crdts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"libraries-systems","title":"库与系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/practice/libraries-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls-tradeoffs","title":"陷阱与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs"}]}]}